{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12165","headline":"谢张法曹万顷小山暇景见忆 · 钱起","name":"谢张法曹万顷小山暇景见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐道随去处，养和解朝簪。\n茅堂近丹阙，佳致亦何深。\n退食不趋府，忘机还在林。\n清风乱流上，永日小山阴。\n解箨雨中竹，将雏花际禽。\n物华对幽寂，弦酌兼咏吟。\n自昔仰高步，及兹劳所钦。\n郢歌叨继组，知己复知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}